entry test
module memories
int[] integers 3 42 43 44
float signal 1.5
float64 precise 16777217.0f64
int8[] signedBytes 3 -128 1 2
int8u[] unsignedBytes 2 255 7
int16[] signedWords 2 -32768 3
int16u[] unsignedWords 2 65535 4
moduleEnd

module references
int& start &memories:0
int& namedStart &memories:integers
float& signal &memories:1
float64& precise &memories:2
int8& signedByte &memories:3
int8u& unsignedByte &memories:4
int16& signedWord &memories:5
int16u& unsignedWord &memories:6
